  dialogue:
  - "You: So what do you recommend to order here? \r\n"
  - "You: So what do you recommend to order here? \r\n"
  - 'Date: OH. I for sure always get the black coffee. No sugar, creamer, or any
    of those extra things people like to put in their cup.

'
  - "Date:  Just a triple scoop of protein powder ya feel.  \r\n"
